 reporting; electrical and electronic equipment; remote monitoring and predictive maintenance systems; lifecycle performance management software; product repairing, refurbishing, or remanufacturing services; spare parts; and software as a service. Schneider Electric S.E. was founded in 1836 and is headquartered in Rueil-Malmaison, France.","fullTimeEmployees":156399,"city":"Rueil-Malmaison","country":"France","website":"https://www.se.com","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","sector":"Industrials"},"news":[],"info_date":"2026-10-31"}